ESP-LOCAL-001
Endpoint-Local NUVL Placement and Physical Execution Gating
CURATED EVIDENCE RECORD

Record type:
Curated record assembled from observed test outputs.
This file is not represented as a continuous raw terminal capture.

======================================================================
OBJECTIVE
======================================================================

Determine whether authority-admissibility recognition can execute
directly on a resource-constrained physical endpoint and gate local
physical command issuance without relying on the Raspberry Pi as the
recognition boundary.

