======================================================================
REPRESENTATION-AMBIGUITY FINDING
======================================================================

During testing, the initial implementation accepted an otherwise valid
request containing an additional unrecognized field:

{"device_id":"esp32-xiao-servo-01","context":"esp_local_demo","action":"move_servo","extra":"ignored"}

Observed initial result:
accepted

The behavior was treated as a representation-ambiguity defect. The
recognition component was accepting information outside the
representation it interpreted.

The recognition logic was changed to reject fields outside:

device_id
context
action

The same extra-field request was then tested again.

Observed corrected result:
decision: denied
reason: unexpected_field

The valid request was subsequently retested.

Observed regression-check result:
decision: accepted
reason: authority_admissible
device_id: esp32-xiao-servo-01

RESULT:
Defect identified and corrected.
Unexpected-field denial: PASS
Valid-path regression check: PASS

